  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "營建工程與管理概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO CONSTRUCTION ENGINEERING AND MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "讓學者對營建工程及管理所涵蓋的領域有一基本的認識，並介紹營建工程全生命週期及如何應用營建管理方法每一個階段進行控管，以便能適當運用有關的管理技術來處理營建工程管理。",
    "describe_eh": "Let students have a basic understanding of the areas covered by construction engineering and management, and introduce the construction project life cycle and how to apply construction management methods at each stage to control, so that relevant management technologies can be properly used to handle construction project management.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
